; corners and 12 dp inside. PauseBadge: the round plate of the emblem (24 dp corners on a 48 dp
; square). PauseCheck: the empty circle of an open objective, a 2 dp muted line on nothing.
; PauseButton: a dark plate with a 1 dp edge and 16 dp in front of the glyph, 8 dp corners.
; PausePrimary is the accent's fill with dark type, PauseDanger the same plate with the danger
; red on word and glyph. PauseChip and PauseChipOff: the toggle chips, the accent's light on the
; plate while on, the muted grey on a dimmer plate while off. PauseMuted: the small grey caps line
